Description:
 ros-jazzy-legged-model - Model of legged robot
Changes:
 ros-jazzy-legged-model (3.4.0-2026.07.28.12.01) noble; urgency=high
 .
   * Migrate to Pinocchio 4.0
     Replace the removed pinocchio/multibody/data.hpp include with the
     consolidated pinocchio/multibody.hpp, and link the pinocchio::pinocchio
     CMake target in the two targets whose sources instantiate Pinocchio
     templates (legged_model constructs Model/Data and parses URDF;
     legged_chainable_controllers holds a pinocchio::Model by value in
     JointSensors.h). Pinocchio 4.0 delivers its Boost.MPL configuration
     (BOOST_MPL_LIMIT_LIST_SIZE=30 etc.) as interface compile definitions on
     its CMake targets instead of in-header defines, and instantiating the
     25-member joint variant exceeds Boost's default limit without them.
     Targets that merely include the headers without instantiating the
     variant do not need the link.
     Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
